<section class="bg-ink text-paper">
  <div class="container-px section-pad">
    <h2 class="font-display text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-4xl">
      Why trust this guide
    </h2>

    <p class="mt-5 max-w-[68ch] leading-relaxed text-paper/80">
      This guide is written by travel editors who have stood in Beijing's Lunar New Year
      temple fairs, been soaked at the Water Splashing Festival in Xishuangbanna, and
      watched the Shoton thangka unroll at dawn in Lhasa. We are not a booking platform
      and take no payment for placements, every festival recommendation is ours alone.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-10 grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
      <div class="border-t border-paper/20 pt-4">
        <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-paper/50">On the ground</p>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-paper/80">
          First-hand from Spring Festival temple fairs, the Water Splashing Festival,
          the Shoton thangka unveiling, and Harbin's ice parks.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="border-t border-paper/20 pt-4">
        <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-paper/50">Sources</p>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-paper/80">
          Dates follow the State Council's official holiday schedule and each local
          government's festival announcements, with lunar-to-Gregorian conversion.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm">
          <a href="https://www.gov.cn/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-paper/80 underline transition-colors hover:text-paper">State Council</a>
          <span class="text-paper/50"> · </span>
          <a href="https://www.nia.gov.cn/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-paper/80 underline transition-colors hover:text-paper">National Immigration Administration</a>
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="border-t border-paper/20 pt-4">
        <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-paper/50">Independence</p>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-paper/80">
          No sponsored placements and no paid links. Where we link to our own city
          guides, we say so.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="border-t border-paper/20 pt-4">
        <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-paper/50">Freshness</p>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-paper/80">
          Last updated August 21, 2026. Next refresh January 2028, when the new holiday
          calendar is released.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
